%% Loading cluster assignments from a .clu file
% This function loads cluster assignments from a .clu file. The first
% value in the file specifies the number of clusters, while the remaining
% values contain the cluster assignment for each detected spike.
%
% The function reads the cluster assignments and determines the actual
% number of clusters from the maximum cluster ID. It returns both the
% cluster assignment vector and the number of detected clusters.

% [Clu, nClusters] = LoadClu(FileName)
%
% A simple matlab function to load a .clu file

